1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,320
Hum Diwali asal mein kyun manate hain?

2
00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:04,025
Aap har saal Diwali manate ho,

3
00:00:04,045 --> 00:00:06,380
par shayad iski 5 kahaniyon mein se sirf

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,310
ek jaante ho.

5
00:00:07,390 --> 00:00:08,570
Baaki chaar kaun si hain?

6
00:00:08,590 --> 00:00:10,300
Pehli, jo sab jaante hain.

7
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,620
Shri Ram 14 saal ke vanvaas ke baad

8
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:15,090
Ayodhya laute, aur logon ne unke swagat

9
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,050
mein diye jalaye.

10
00:00:16,070 --> 00:00:17,790
Doosri, South India mein.

11
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:20,250
Wahan Diwali Shri Krishna ki Narakasura pe

12
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,935
jeet ki khushi mein manayi jaati hai.

13
00:00:21,955 --> 00:00:24,230
Isse Naraka Chaturdashi bhi kehte hain.

14
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:25,860
Teesri, Lakshmi Puja.

15
00:00:25,880 --> 00:00:28,100
Is raat Maa Lakshmi ki pooja hoti hai,

16
00:00:28,120 --> 00:00:30,110
ghar mein sukh aur samriddhi ke liye.

17
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:31,760
Chauthi, Jain dharm mein.

18
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:34,200
Maana jaata hai ki isi din Bhagwan Mahavir

19
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:35,430
ko nirvaan mila tha,

20
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,900
isliye Jain samaj bhi diye jalata hai.

21
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,790
Aur paanchvi, Sikh dharm mein.

22
00:00:39,810 --> 00:00:41,990
Isi samay Bandi Chhor Divas manaya jaata

23
00:00:42,010 --> 00:00:44,310
hai, jab Guru Hargobind Sahib ji ki rihaai

24
00:00:44,330 --> 00:00:46,570
ki khushi mein Golden Temple roshni se

25
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:47,580
jagmagata hai.

26
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,810
Matlab diye wahi, kahaniyan alag.

27
00:00:49,830 --> 00:00:51,470
Par sabka sandesh ek hai:

28
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:53,450
andhere pe roshni ki jeet.

29
00:00:53,470 --> 00:00:55,750
Aise roz ke "kyun" ke liye Whysplained ko

30
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:56,750
subscribe karo.

31
00:00:56,770 --> 00:00:59,000
Aapko Diwali ki shubhkaamnayein!
